# Design System

Follow `.rules/design-system.md` (canonical). Summary:

- Theme modes live ONLY in `design/theme.tokens.json`:
  `light-google` (Google palette: blue primary, red secondary, green/orange/pink/yellow),
  `light-orange` (light+dark orange, blue/green accents, yellow card strokes),
  `dark-speakeasy` (dark, rainbow strokes, live animated background),
  `dark-orange` (deep black, orange pair, blue/green accents, yellow card/button strokes).
- NEVER hardcode colors, gradients, radii, shadows, spacing, or font values at component
  level — CSS variables / tokens only, including inline styles, Tailwind arbitrary values,
  SVG fills, and chart configs.
- Visual language: clean white space, large icons, card components, light drop shadows,
  tight vector look.
